Subject: CPMS I02A Gate Pipe Timeout Fault

& [Detection] a five-second chained command deadline left a transient Cargo build lock, then a sixty-second workspace-test deadline closed stdout while test enumeration was active
& [ObservedFailure] Rust test harness workers reported BrokenPipe and SendError only after the controlling pipe was closed
& [Classification] verification orchestration fault not product assertion failure
& [Impact] the interrupted run cannot support a pass claim; no source, schema output, runtime authority, external effect, or test fixture was altered by the failure
& [Repair] confirm no cargo rustc or target test process remains and rerun each gate in a long-lived yielded cell with a non-severing deadline
& [Prevention] do not use a hard shell timeout shorter than the complete workspace suite; yield and wait on the live cell instead
& [Resolution] complete uninterrupted debug and release workspace suites later passed
& [Disposition] resolved_by_nonsevering_full_reruns
